WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Kneel and place a bolster or stack of pillows lengthwise between the knees.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Fold forward and rest the torso and cheek on the support.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Arms can wrap the bolster or rest alongside it.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Soften the jaw and let the breath move the back ribs.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Press into the hands to rise slowly when ready.
